<title>ITALY: BOXING-SHKALIKOV WINS EUROPEAN SUPER-MIDDLEWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-SHKALIKOV WINS EUROPEAN SUPER-MIDDLEWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MAZARA DEL VALLO, Sicily 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Andrei Shkalikov won the vacant European super-middleweight title on Saturday when he stopped Italian Mauro Galvano in the eighth round.</p>
</text>
